# OVERRIDE example — copy to OVERRIDE and fill in to sanction an
# override-bound claim (the blob sha at use time is recorded in the ledger).
# A placeholder-filled file is NOT an override — that is the point of this
# example. The override is the blob at HEAD of the current branch; an
# uncommitted working-tree copy is fail-closed.
scope: <story-id>   # or ALL
by: <human name>
reason: <why — required, no placeholders>
date: <UTC>
